{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Football</strong> blends high-speed driving with the precision of competitive football. Time your hits, control the ball, and send it rocketing into the net. Every match is a showcase of reflexes, positioning, and smart plays.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Matches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face AI in <strong>1v1, 2v2, and 3v3</strong>\u00a0game modes. Read the bounce, outmaneuver defenders, and strike at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/c8aeabfc297d640084254530b06ddd1c.poster.avif?t=1757017267\" width=1138 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/c8aeabfc297d640084254530b06ddd1c.webm?t=1757017267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/c8aeabfc297d640084254530b06ddd1c.mp4?t=1757017267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and Master 20+ Cars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and master <strong>20+ unlockable cars</strong>, each with distinct handling and visuals. Find the ride that fits your style and refine your technique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/6dd453682a655d36be5d198be93cb408.poster.avif?t=1757017267\" width=1138 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/6dd453682a655d36be5d198be93cb408.webm?t=1757017267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/6dd453682a655d36be5d198be93cb408.mp4?t=1757017267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics-Driven Ball Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bounce, deflection, and pinch is physics-based. Master plays, taps, and crucial saves to turn close matches into highlights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/52a9438688fec8b6dd9c47102e83260d.poster.avif?t=1757017267\" width=1138 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/52a9438688fec8b6dd9c47102e83260d.webm?t=1757017267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/52a9438688fec8b6dd9c47102e83260d.mp4?t=1757017267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skill-based, physics-driven football on wheels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>1v1, 2v2, 3v3</strong> vs adaptive AI</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>20+ unlockable cars</strong> with distinct handling and looks</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>5 unique stadiums</strong> with varied atmospheres</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast matches designed for instant action and replayability</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832870?t=1757017267","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/6143eb26d0de26584d9eddd896f62d405b8c669e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757017267","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/31ec2938f68be07f84ca1d1ee2cea7294cdde029/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757017267","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/31ec2938f68be07f84ca1d1ee2cea7294cdde029/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757017267","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Football</strong> blends high-speed driving with the precision of competitive football. Time your hits, control the ball, and send it rocketing into the net. Every match is a showcase of reflexes, positioning, and smart plays.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Matches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face AI in <strong>1v1, 2v2, and 3v3</strong>\u00a0game modes. Read the bounce, outmaneuver defenders, and strike at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/c8aeabfc297d640084254530b06ddd1c.poster.avif?t=1757017267\" width=1138 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/c8aeabfc297d640084254530b06ddd1c.webm?t=1757017267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832870/extras/c8aeabfc297d640084254530b06ddd1c.mp4?t=1757017267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and Master 20+ Cars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and master <strong>20+ unlockable cars</strong>, each with distinct handling and visuals. Find the ride that fits your style and refine your technique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn